Z||000000||batboy||03-28-2000||12:02 AM||||The Batmobile (in case you've been living in a cave like Ogre and me, that's my V8 Fiero) now has a list of Forum sponsors. I personally want to thank all these great folks for contributing parts or services. The Batmobile is still a long ways from being done, but it sure would not be this far along without you. Thanks again. Hope I didn't forget anyone.<P>Bruce who sent a free side air scoop.<P>Greendano who did the work on my front rotors into hubs for the Grand Am swap.<P>Monkeyman who sent me the bat vinyl inserts for the taillight mod.<P>Phil who sent me a pair of door map pocket for cheap.<P>BHooper who sent me a blue dingy thingy for free.<P>Cooter who sent me a rear spoiler (not a factory one) for only shipping costs.<P>And everyone else who has provided advice, support, encouragement, and friendship.<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 03-28-2000).]||||reg||6
